    "description": "<ul><li><strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your geometry box with a name or unique message, making it a special and identifiable item.</li><li><strong>Durable and Sturdy Construction:</strong> Made from high-quality materials to withstand daily use and last throughout the school year.</li><li><strong>Complete Geometry Set:</strong> Includes all essential tools like a compass, protractor, ruler, and set squares, perfect for students of all ages.</li><li><strong>Secure Storage:</strong> Features a secure latch to keep all tools safely in place, preventing loss or damage.</li><li><strong>Compact and Portable:</strong> Easy to carry in a school bag or backpack, ideal for both classroom and home use.</li><li><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Designed with a smooth, scratch-resistant surface that maintains its look over time.</li><li><strong>Ideal Gift Option:</strong> A thoughtful and practical gift for students, with the added touch of personalization.</li><li><strong>Eco-Friendly Choice:</strong> Reusable and reduces the need for multiple purchases, contributing to a more sustainable lifestyle.</li></ul>",
